<title>NEW ZEALAND: AMP declares stake in Tourism Holdings.</title>
<headline>AMP declares stake in Tourism Holdings.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fund manager AMP Investments Ltd on Tuesday declared in a substantial security notice that on April 15 it had a 5.86 percent stake in tourism company Tourism Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
